  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1901.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1901.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b), below, this chapter shall apply to the owner or operator of any incinerator or wood waste burner.\n\n(b) This chapter shall not apply to the owner or operator of an incinerator or wood waste burner that is subject to rules or plans authorized by and adopted in accordance with Section 129 of the Clean Air Act.\n\nSource. #10317, eff 4-23-13 (from Env-A 1902.01); ss by #13697, eff 7-22-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1900.html"
